This is a desktop application for analyzing and optimizing Windows startup, which helps to speed up the system boot and improve its responsiveness.

 Over time, the computer grows with programs that register themselves in the startup without the user's knowledge.
This slows down the start of Windows and reduces the performance. Optimizator solves this problem by providing a convenient tool
for managing the startup based on data from a specialized database.

